<title>GERMANY: MG says 95/96 profit soars 70 pct.</title>
<headline>MG says 95/96 profit soars 70 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Business year 1995/1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     290     vs 171</p>
<p>    Group sales				  16,000  vs 17,600</p>
<p>    Group workforce on Sept 30, 1996     23,000  vs 23,378</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German metals and mining group is Metallgesellschaft. The group said lower sales were attributed to a planned reduction in trading activities. The group said it will present a more detailed results overview later in the day.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
